0.377); ANOVA F \= 0.882 (p \= 0.674); between-curve variance ratio
0.882 (observed sd of curve means 422,588 against 449,754 expected from
the pooled single-solve spread); largest |z| 2.39 against the Bonferroni
threshold 3.21; curves beyond it: none.

