=== Figures
<figures>
Every figure draws recorded values only (`plot.py`). The standard
volcano diagrams (`tools/volcano-diagram`) place each measured curve at
its level in one ℓ-volcano with every walked edge drawn; the 3D heat
maps stack the endomorphism-ring strata (rings, crater on top) and
colour each measured curve by its mean operations or its mean end-to-end
time (transport + solve).

